<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, probably about two dozen people have seen me naked and I’ll probably be cringing about today every night for the next 10 years whenever I go to sleep, but it could have gone worse!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> says as he tosses aside the fur skirt and pulls his bottoms back on. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’ve never been so happy to get dressed in my life!”</span> You chuckle, praising his performance on stage as he finishes getting dressed. <span style="Color: LightGreen"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> tries to play it off as nothing, but he genuinely seems proud of himself.</span> <br>
<br>
