<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It was pretty fun, actually, much more fun than what we did before hand, anyway.”</span> You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> both blush at the memories of the park, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But next time, maybe a bigger costume?”</span> <br>
