<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, maybe save that for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Richard</span>.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> chuckles, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But you really were a big help today. I mean it, thanks so much!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> goes to shake his hand, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> instead gives him a big hug, lifting the slightly flustered <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> off the ground and spinning him around. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ehm… Right! Well, I better get to helping clean up and stuff, access the damage, but the writer seemed happy with your changes. So, I’d say we’re in the clear. Goodluck with your hat! You’ll have to show me sometime.”</span> <br>
